      "body": "> Implementation for MD-17982 (sub-task of MD-17947)\n\\*\\*Test Suggestion:\\*\\*\n- Open Item → Line Build editor for any item.\n- On a procedure step, set Activity = COOK. Confirm the \"IK Eligible\" checkbox now appears (below the appliance / config block).\n- Check IK Eligible on a COOK step with NO machine-eligible sub-step: inline error \"Missing attribute Machine Eligible.\" shows, and Save is blocked with the existing per-task toast.\n- Add a machine-eligible sub-step, save, reload — the COOK step retains IK Eligible.\n- Toggle Activity COOK ↔ GARNISH: checkbox value is preserved. Switch to COMPLETE or VEND: value clears.\n\\*\\*What I Changed:\\*\\*\n- `utils/machineEligible.ts`: new `isIkEligibleActivity` predicate; widened activity guards to COOK | GARNISH.\n- `Activity/IkEligibleField.tsx`, `Activity/index.tsx`, `Activity/useActivity.ts`: render gate  activity-change preservation via predicate; checkbox repositioned below appliance config.\n- `utils/fixturesProcedures.ts`: init  both submit transforms keep `is_ik_eligible_selected` for COOK.\n- `Header/saveHelper.tsx`: `checkIkEligibleMachineEligible` validates COOK.\n\\*\\*Code Review:\\*\\* APPROVE — P0:0 P1:0.\n\\*\\*Browser Verification:\\*\\* SKIP (feature flow, no --verify flag).",
